{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25415","headline":"遥伤茅山县孙尊师三首 三 · 李德裕","name":"遥伤茅山县孙尊师三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空宇留丹竈，层霞被羽衣。\n旧山闻鹿化，遗舃尚凫飞。\n数日奇香在，何年白鹤归。\n想君旋下泪，方欵里闾扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}